  "details": "**Description**\n\nWhen we received Request Invite in an invite only instance of another user, it's impossible to click accept check. (This is expected)\n\nAfter moving to an invite-able instance (Public, Group Public, Friends+, Group+, Invite+, or my own Invite or Friends Only instances), it should be possible to accept invite request.\n\nHowever, it’s impossible because accept checkbox is still un-clickable. (This is unexpected)\n\nIt should be possible to accept Invite Request after moving to other invite-able instance.\n\n**日本語要約**\n\nReqInを受けたあとに別のインスタンスに移動したとしてもReqInを許可できない問題です\n\n**Related Canny**\n\nI and my friend wrote multiple Canny about Request Invite.\n\nRequest Inviteに関わる同時に書いた他のCannyがいくつかあります\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-be-grayed-out-or-not-present-when-im-in-an\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-not-be-clickable-if-im-in-friends-instance\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-be-clickable-after-moving-to-friends-or-pu (this canny)\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-not-be-clickable-after-moving-to-invite-in",
